+day/item, notes, profiles, and every other kind writes `del:true`. Retain all
+tombstones one year from winning clock. GC only during successful authenticated
+v1 transaction after remote/local merge; never offline/local-only. Remove only
+expired tombstones from both canonical copies, atomically.
 
