-## Migration and compatibility
+First v1 load converts materialised state without loss. Per entry, seed clock
+from best existing timestamp: value `at` where present (`answers`, `notes`,
+etc.), else relevant `updatedAt`; schedule uses containing state `updatedAt`.
+Use `[timestamp,0,deviceId]`, never migration time. Assign legacy schedule item
